{321}{What do I know of this place?  This is Tarant!  What DON'T I know of it.  Full of barbarous technologists and uncultured laborers.  The whole damned city SCREAMS "new money".  We'll be hard pressed to find a decent cup of tea in this place.  Not to mention, they're not very fond of magickal types like myself. }{What do I know of this place?  This is Tarant!  What DON'T I know of it.  Full of barbarous technologists and uncultured laborers.  The whole damned city SCREAMS "new money".  We'll be hard pressed to find a decent cup of tea in this place.  Not to mention, they're not very fond of magickal types like myself. }{}{50}{}{}
