{325}{Caladon?  Oh, not a bad place...better than Tarant, but not much.  Full of old nobles who wouldn't know good taste from their rumpled bloomers.  And they've still got a bloody king here!  Talk about antiquated political views!  It's enough to make a man toss his crumpets...}{Caladon?  Oh, not a bad place...better than Tarant, but not much.  Full of old nobles who wouldn't know good taste from their rumpled bloomers.  And they've still got a bloody king here!  Talk about antiquated political views!  It's enough to make a man toss his crumpets...}{}{51}{}{}
