{329}{DERNholm?  Oh god...don't get me started.  There's never been a more pathetic, boring, depressing place in the history of Arcanum!  Wasn't always this way, but good old King Praetor has doomed the place through his stupendous short-sightedness.  The sooner we leave here, the better...}{DERNholm?  Oh god...don't get me started.  There's never been a more pathetic, boring, depressing place in the history of Arcanum!  Wasn't always this way, but good old King Praetor has doomed the place through his stupendous short-sightedness.  The sooner we leave here, the better...}{}{52}{}{}
