{337}{Yes, yes...I know a bit about Stillwater.  They've got some legend about a creature who roams the hills, sucking the flesh off of unwary hunters or something like that.  You know me...always ready to hear a good scary story.  I think they make fairly good weapons here as well...}{Yes, yes...I know a bit about Stillwater.  They've got some legend about a creature who roams the hills, sucking the flesh off of unwary hunters or something like that.  You know me...always ready to hear a good scary story.  I think they make fairly good weapons here as well...}{}{54}{}{}
