{341}{Oh, I know Tulla all too well.  Spent two of the most BORING years here.  Didn't leave on the best of terms with the headmaster, if you know what I mean.  Crotchety old codger, goes by the name of Simeon Tor...}{Oh, I know Tulla all too well.  Spent two of the most BORING years here.  Didn't leave on the best of terms with the headmaster, if you know what I mean.  Crotchety old codger, goes by the name of Simeon Tor...}{}{55}{}{}
