{357}{This?  Oh, it's only the Isle of Thanatos.  Monster Island, I think they call it.  Can't say as I'm extremely happy to be here, considering that it's more than likely the most dangerous place in all of Arcanum.  Have I thanked you for the wonderful holiday, my friend?}{This?  Oh, it's only the Isle of Thanatos.  Monster Island, I think they call it.  Can't say as I'm extremely happy to be here, considering that it's more than likely the most dangerous place in all of Arcanum.  Have I thanked you for the wonderful holiday, my friend?}{}{59}{}{}
