{494}{The Isle of Despair?  Well of course, who doesn't?  It's just off the eastern coast...here, I'll mark your map with it.  [He does so.]  Not that it's going to do you any good...there's no way to get there, seeing as how it's a prison colony.  Not exactly the kind of place you go for holiday...}{The Isle of Despair?  Well of course, who doesn't?  It's just off the eastern coast...here, I'll mark your map with it.  [He does so.]  Not that it's going to do you any good...there's no way to get there, seeing as how it's a prison colony.  Not exactly the kind of place you go for holiday...}{}{60}{}{mm 19}
