{498}{Qintarra?  The elven tree-city?  Well, if I knew that I'd be a rich man!  Not that I'm poor by any standards, of course.  But the location of Qintarra is a well sought after secret...you'll be hard pressed to find someone who knows where it is...}{Qintarra?  The elven tree-city?  Well, if I knew that I'd be a rich man!  Not that I'm poor by any standards, of course.  But the location of Qintarra is a well sought after secret...you'll be hard pressed to find someone who knows where it is...}{}{61}{}{}
