{502}{Victor Misk?  Yes, the name is familiar.  Fairly respected collector of books, unless I am quite mistaken.  Which I RARELY am.  I believe the fellow lives in Caladon...there's just no accounting for some men's tastes...}{Victor Misk?  Yes, the name is familiar.  Fairly respected collector of books, unless I am quite mistaken.  Which I RARELY am.  I believe the fellow lives in Caladon...there's just no accounting for some men's tastes...}{}{62}{}{}
