{506}{Arronax!  Bloody powerful old elf, unless I'm mixing him up with someone else...there were so many damned elves running around during the Age of Legends.  I swear, if you didn't have pointy ears and a ghostish complexion back then you weren't making the historical who's who.  So VERY old-fashioned...}{Arronax!  Bloody powerful old elf, unless I'm mixing him up with someone else...there were so many damned elves running around during the Age of Legends.  I swear, if you didn't have pointy ears and a ghostish complexion back then you weren't making the historical who's who.  So VERY old-fashioned...}{}{63}{}{}
