{510}{Didn't we go over this already?  Oh, that's right...we were speaking of the other fellow.  Nasrudin...let's see...head of the Elven Council during the Age of Legends, I believe.  I'm also fairly certain that those Panarii seem to hold him in fairly high regard as well.  Elven wisdom and all that.  Bloody boring, if you ask me...}{Didn't we go over this already?  Oh, that's right...we were speaking of the other fellow.  Nasrudin...let's see...head of the Elven Council during the Age of Legends, I believe.  I'm also fairly certain that those Panarii seem to hold him in fairly high regard as well.  Elven wisdom and all that.  Bloody boring, if you ask me...}{}{64}{}{}
